    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθέτη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξα ἡμιονική,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄθιζα.</span>) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθεύει:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγει, φροντίζει,</span> Id. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθρεῖν,</span> and v. sq.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθέω</span></b> , only <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθέων: φροντίζων,</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄθεσαν:
			ἐπεστράφησαν,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄθη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντίς, ὤρα, φόβος, λόγος,</span> Id.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄθημον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑστερινόν,</span> Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
